; ==============================================================================
; MARK: 11-6: 💬 大魔女の計画
; ==============================================================================
; ＠ト書き▼議論11-6大魔女の計画
; 議論開始カットイン
; BGM継続：AccUhEarts(Vocal無)
@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_15_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

# Judge11-6-1

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-First
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Effect
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Last
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:false ProcessTimer:true

@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.13
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:确实，我的行为<br>未必每一个都称得上合理。|#0206Trial06_Yuki001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Normal1,ArmL5,Angle01/ArmR-,Eyes1_Flushed_Open1,Mouth1_Pensive_Closed1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……你承认<br>自己是被情绪<br>驱动的吗？|#0206Trial06_Nanoka001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.7
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:是的。<br>如今再继续掩饰这个事实<br>也没有意义。|#0206Trial06_Yuki002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.7
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"我的一切行动<br>本就是<link=\"Objection_02_06_06_01\">为了复仇</link>。|#0206Trial06_Yuki003|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.8
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:因同胞被杀所带来的<br>愤怒、<br>悲伤、<br>怨恨、<br>憎恶……|#0206Trial06_Yuki004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.15
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:为了告慰这些感情，<br>我不停思索着，<br>应该让人类<br>以怎样凄惨的死状<br>迎来末日。|#0206Trial06_Yuki005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.15
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:简单粗暴地说，<br>这样的做法的确可以被分类为——<br>【感情用事】吧。|#0206Trial06_Yuki006| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.3
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"……不过，<br>你们也喜欢这样吧？<br><link=\"Objection_02_06_06_02\">随心所欲</link>、<br>全凭情绪地行动……|#0206Trial06_Yuki007|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Default,ArmR3,ArmL3,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Closed01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Noah Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"诺亚也不会做<br>自己<link=\"Objection_02_06_06_03\">不愿意的事</link>。|#0206Trial06_Noah001|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.3
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:那，说不定<br>你们也能理解我。|#0206Trial06_Yuki008| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.13
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:也就是说，<br>哪怕我的行为<br>看起来并不合理，<br>那也只是因为你们<br>无法理解罢了。<br>……仅此而已。|#0206Trial06_Yuki009| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.11
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"由【<link=\"Objection_02_06_06_04\">身为人类的艾玛动手</link>，<br>亲自给人类致命一击】……<br>这才是我复仇的<br>完美落幕。|#0206Trial06_Yuki010|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:50,70 Roll:0

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.6
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"我所做的每一件事，<br>都是为了<link=\"Objection_02_06_06_05\">让人类饱受折磨</link><br>所必需的步骤。|#0206Trial06_Yuki011|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.14
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:把杀死魔女的魔法<br>交给艾玛，<br>也没什么值得<br>大惊小怪的吧。|#0206Trial06_Yuki012| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,30 Roll:-4

