[PrintTextModified Text:小雪在说谎哦。|#0206Trial06_Noah003| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Center
[PrintTextModified Text:……！|#0206Trial06_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Smile,ArmR5,ArmL4
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left
[PrintTextModified Text:……是啊。我也觉得诺亚说得没错。|#0206Trial06_Margo001| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Smile
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left
[PrintTextModified Text:她不过是在胡乱堆砌些空洞的借口罢了。|#0206Trial06_Margo002| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Smile,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left
[PrintTextModified Text:……至少，在我看来是这样哦？|#0206Trial06_Margo003| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR4,ArmL7,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Surprised_Open01,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Smile_Closed,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Sweat01>Sweat01_01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Center
[PrintTextModified Text:（我和她们看到的东西，可能真的不一样……）|#0206Trial06_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

