; MARK: 11-6-6: ❌ 反論・人間は苦しまない

# Judge11-6-6

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-First
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:false ProcessTimer:false
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-Last

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmL5,ArmR4,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Normal_Open02,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Center
[PrintTextModified Text:就算你做了这些，人类也不会受到折磨的。|#0206Trial06_Ema023| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmL11,ArmR12,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Normal_Open02,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Center
[PrintTextModified Text:当时迫害魔女的人早就不在人世，<br>已经没有人记得了。|#0206Trial06_Ema024| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmL5,ArmR4,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Thinking_Closed01,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Center
[PrintTextModified Text:就算你灭绝了人类，<br>也没有人会忏悔，<br>没有人会被罪恶感折磨……|#0206Trial06_Ema025| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmL11,ArmR12,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Surprised_Open02,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Scream_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Center
[PrintTextModified Text:你的所作所为，不过是毫无意义的自我满足！|#0206Trial06_Ema026| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.5
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:就算如此，那又怎么样呢？|#0206Trial06_Yuki030| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.4
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:人类或许什么都不会思考。|#0206Trial06_Yuki031| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.3
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:对人类来说，或许仅仅只是【不知不觉间就灭绝了】而已。|#0206Trial06_Yuki032| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.4
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:即便如此，我的目的也已经达成。|#0206Trial06_Yuki033| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.4
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:那就是从这个世界上抹杀所有人类……|#0206Trial06_Yuki034| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.6
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:这样，死去的魔女们也会高兴的。|#0206Trial06_Yuki035| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.4
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:当时灭绝了魔女的愚蠢人类们，<br>或许正在地狱里发出绝望和怨恨的叫喊。|#0206Trial06_Yuki036| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.12
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:这才是，<br>失去一切的我，唯一残留的<br>【希望】……|#0206Trial06_Yuki037| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

